* Abdollahi 2025 MDFRGC re-sized for the nominal corner only (higher gain, corner-sensitive)
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibn vdd vbn dc 20u
Mdn vbn vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=1u L=200n AD=0.2p AS=0.2p PD=2.4u PS=2.4u
Cbn vbn 0 2p
Mb in vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=7.995u L=200n AD=1.599p AS=1.599p PD=16.39u PS=16.39u
M1 out x in 0 nmos90 W=6.663u L=100n AD=1.333p AS=1.333p PD=13.73u PS=13.73u
R1 vdd out 2.4582k
M2 x in 0 0 nmos90 W=30.35u L=100n AD=6.071p AS=6.071p PD=61.11u PS=61.11u
R2 vdd x 830.97
M3 x out s3 0 nmos90 W=4.743u L=100n AD=0.9485p AS=0.9485p PD=9.885u PS=9.885u
R3 s3 0 2.3197k
C3 s3 0 90.269f

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;.tran 0 6.667e-08 6.667e-09 6.667e-12   ; eye: replace Iin by the PRBS source below
;Ipr 0 in PWL file=prbs7_3G.txt   ; 20 uA pk-pk NRZ PRBS7 (prbs7_*.txt is in this folder)
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
